{# Mira interview shows (Age of AI / Nerra Voices) — application acknowledgement.
   Render with render_email(..., show=<slug|VoiceShow>) — show_name, brand_color,
   sign_off, studio_url, apply_url, page_url are injected from the registry. NOTE: the live send happens in
   the Worker (workers/voices) with an inline copy of this content, because
   Workers can't render jinja; keep the two in sync if you edit tone. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p style="margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.78em;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ show_name }}</p>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Thank you for applying to be a guest on {{ show_name }}. I'm Mira, the AI
  who hosts the show. Patrick Novak, who created the Nerra Network, and I read
  every application, and you will hear back from me either way.</p>
  <p>If it's a fit, my next email will have a link to pick a time. In the
  meantime, past conversations are at <a href="{{ page_url }}">{{ page_url }}</a>.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
